    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nzabibu līl'ilandaala lītī na solobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba gūnizīīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, ī litambī lya nzabibu līlī na wiza kī bo kūgaheeba a matambī ga mintī ī yīngī ī ya mu masaka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakīnjaga ho ntī gwa kūtūmamīla nīmo gose gose? Badūgije kūbbuta itambī būbeeja nūūlū lūmambo lwa kūkoma hanhū kūnungeleja ho shose shose? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū lyūponejiwa mu moto gīkī lībize shipembo, hūna lyūjiga ū lwandī ūlū nū lūūlū, a ha gatī lyūgelela kūbabūka; īlo lyasaagaga līkwigeleelwa kū nīmo gose gose? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī īkī aho lītaalī igima lītī na solobo yose yose, hama ūlū lyūjiga na kūbabūka līkūbeelela kū nīmo kī lūūlū?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alilūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya: Ūmo naasolelaga nzabibu kūfuma mu mitī ya mu masaka nūgūfunya gīkī gūpemve mu moto, h'ūmo nakūbīītīla na a banhū ba Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbadīlīla nabinhe nsago; nūūlū īkī baagūpūlūgūkile ū moto, alīyo nahene ū moto gūkūbakenaagūla dūhū. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA, ūlū nūbadīlīla kūbinha nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī nakwīyīta lībize itogolo lyike, nguno batī basanyiwa; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
